            <div xml:id="d439">

                <pb facs="0592" n="490" xml:id="pg490"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2438: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-09-25T18:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 25,
                                1919, 6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.16
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>3113. Matter has been repeatedly but informally presented in sense of your 5992
                    September 23rd, 7 p.m., and therefore renewed pressure for reply for reasons
                    advanced in my 3090 September 22nd, 8 p.m., would appear injudicious at this
                    moment. Foreign Office promise to advise me immediately Japanese reply is
                    received.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
